                        "form": "epithalamia"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0293cf5b-fef3-3068-8c1f-d0e902ed2459",
                        "entry_id": "f91338b7-d7fe-3785-b4c0-115187c9972a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A song or poem celebrating a marriage."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "108942db-832d-4078-8726-cfb43ab097fc",
                                "sense_id": "0293cf5b-fef3-3068-8c1f-d0e902ed2459",
                                "text": "Softly she laughed and sighed, and swift her glances flew. She shook her heavy tresses, and their perfume filled the place; she struck her little sandalled foot upon the floor, and hummed a snatch of some old Greek epithalamium."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0bf59022-1a4b-4824-afa1-59add0e2c9ca",
                                "sense_id": "0293cf5b-fef3-3068-8c1f-d0e902ed2459",
                                "text": "He has wittily redone a tardy epithalamium and some nursery rhymes (\"Three blind eunuchs\"), and deftly catches the cozy lawnfuls of plastic dwarfs and flamingos, outside the kenneled people."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f793d4c8-04fb-3d11-afff-3868b9505f0f",
                        "entry_id": "f91338b7-d7fe-3785-b4c0-115187c9972a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A song in praise of the bride or bridegroom"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2de95cda-8f9d-4270-84d2-6b215765941d",
                                "sense_id": "f793d4c8-04fb-3d11-afff-3868b9505f0f",
                                "text": "The Caves of Ajanta, the medieval Courts of Love, the epithalamia of the erotic poets [...] all testify to the glorification of manhood, the supremacy of the sex motif."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ca49a33c-1003-4c9c-a497-99026fee3d34",
                        "source_entry_id": "f91338b7-d7fe-3785-b4c0-115187c9972a",
                        "source_sense_description": "song or poem celebrating a marriage",
                        "target_lang_word": "épithalame",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "épithalame",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d1660245-42d3-310a-a714-0d3d3859c3c7",
                                        "entry_id": "8212492d-f587-36dd-ad7e-f90a694010d5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Poème lyrique composé à l’occasion d’un mariage en l’honneur des nouveaux époux."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9298941-3e1b-4b50-9fd9-1508dbdef4da",
                                                "sense_id": "d1660245-42d3-310a-a714-0d3d3859c3c7",
                                                "text": "Les fêtes du mariage ne pouvaient se passer d’un épithalame, Venantius Fortunatus en composa un dans le goût classique, et il le récita devant l’étrange auditoire qui se pressait autour de lui."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f5c67cf-2bcb-4709-bed5-29addcd71edd",
                                                "sense_id": "d1660245-42d3-310a-a714-0d3d3859c3c7",
                                                "text": "Près du chêne pyramidal\nNous menons les épithalames\nEt nous ne suivons pas Stendhal\nSur le terrain des vieilles dames."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b5b9725b-ecb3-471a-a380-242f765a8849",
                                                "sense_id": "d1660245-42d3-310a-a714-0d3d3859c3c7",
                                                "text": "Accueillez la voix qui persiste\nDans son naïf épithalame,\nAllez, rien n'est meilleur à l'âme\nQue de faire une âme moins triste !"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c72f10cb-00c6-4f59-b3a5-feb13919c6cf",
                                                "sense_id": "d1660245-42d3-310a-a714-0d3d3859c3c7",
                                                "text": "Or ça ! fit Ésope II, n’y a-t-il point ici quelque poëte habile pour composer mon épithalame ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9eb3e74f-8d84-4a27-ba5d-83a3035f0d42",
                                                "sense_id": "d1660245-42d3-310a-a714-0d3d3859c3c7",
                                                "text": "C’était un épithalame de Néron, et il avait le pouvoir de faire mourir quiconque l’écoutait négligemment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
